                        ],
                        "form": "die Hitzeflimmer"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9eb88e8e-4b0a-3d51-a7ce-9b749b605064",
                        "entry_id": "3b909adf-f568-36cb-be88-ec8318f1966a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "bei heißen Außentemperaturen in Bodennähe auftretender optischer Effekt, der durch die Ablenkung von Lichtstrahlen an unterschiedlich warmen Luftschichten verursacht wird, wodurch eine flimmernde Turbulenz der Luft entsteht"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf22b631-3e5f-4489-903b-1399a8c746cc",
                                "sense_id": "9eb88e8e-4b0a-3d51-a7ce-9b749b605064",
                                "text": "„Ein Hitzeflimmer verschiebt die Konturen der Dinge, als bewegten sie sich vibrierend um sich selbst.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "295eda0f-951a-483a-845c-f11c0323df43",
                                "sense_id": "9eb88e8e-4b0a-3d51-a7ce-9b749b605064",
                                "text": "„Kehrst Du nämlich bei Tageslicht in unsere Mauern ein, tauchst Du aus dem Hitzeflimmer der Wüste vom Morgen her in unsere Schatten oder näherst Du Dich abendher von der Seeseite unserem Felsennest, so meinst Du wohl, Du seist an eine entsetzliche Stätte geraten, wo ein verheerendes Schicksal alles Leben ausgelöscht habe, so sehr hat es sich in die hintersten Winkel seiner Behausungen zurückgezogen und brütet dort trüb-blinzelnd dem Abend entgegen, der etwas Handwerker- und Handelstätigkeit auf den Straßen mit sich bringt.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "768add42-2421-4adc-ad30-9d44b90ed336",
                                "sense_id": "9eb88e8e-4b0a-3d51-a7ce-9b749b605064",
                                "text": "„Die Landschaft tanzt im Hitzeflimmer.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d88ff133-95ea-4546-aefc-6df39ddab1f8",
                                "sense_id": "9eb88e8e-4b0a-3d51-a7ce-9b749b605064",
                                "text": "„Im Osten schwammen im Hitzeflimmer Schluchten, Krater und die Trugbilder des Moab.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9df330c-0ae8-4cda-ac8d-70a3382fb76a",
                                "sense_id": "9eb88e8e-4b0a-3d51-a7ce-9b749b605064",
                                "text": "„Schienen, das sind zwei sich krümmende Parallelen, glänzend und stählern auf graublauem Schotter, endlos laufen sie in die Landschaft hinaus, nie sich vereinend, und im Sommer liegt über ihnen der Hitzeflimmer kleiner Kristalle.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "794a33e0-4e21-4bbc-ba0b-954df5f5977b",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b909adf-f568-36cb-be88-ec8318f1966a",
                        "source_sense_id": "9eb88e8e-4b0a-3d51-a7ce-9b749b605064",
                        "target_lang_word": "heat haze",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "heat haze",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f3f2a96-7bf1-38de-80df-865250a57b2d",
                                        "entry_id": "6e49e603-3f4d-3eec-9299-813645898c2e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A shimmering atmospheric disturbance caused by currents of warm air between the observer and the object observed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a16a0a1a-dd93-48bb-b59e-2bcb81c5d4a9",
                                                "sense_id": "4f3f2a96-7bf1-38de-80df-865250a57b2d",
                                                "text": "Under increase of heat, it volatilizes faster, so as to become dimly visible in large mass, as a heat-haze."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c9bae19-940a-4ffb-b9fb-59b74dcb3efa",
                                                "sense_id": "4f3f2a96-7bf1-38de-80df-865250a57b2d",
                                                "text": "Behind them, stretching in a long line east and west, were the Roan and Book Cliffs, cut to their base by the river's gorge, and meandering away in long wavy lines distorted by heat haze and the smoke of forest fires."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "21523bf3-4171-4382-9f54-002a018c0564",
                                                "sense_id": "4f3f2a96-7bf1-38de-80df-865250a57b2d",
                                                "text": "Sol squinted out over the barrens to where the mountains shimmered in the heat haze."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "29f247f6-32cf-4bfe-9dd2-21d61b43613d",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b909adf-f568-36cb-be88-ec8318f1966a",
                        "source_sense_id": "9eb88e8e-4b0a-3d51-a7ce-9b749b605064",
                        "target_lang_word": "heat shimmer",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "838b6d53-dbb2-438e-be2f-4aff57091f7a",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b909adf-f568-36cb-be88-ec8318f1966a",
                        "source_sense_id": "9eb88e8e-4b0a-3d51-a7ce-9b749b605064",
                        "target_lang_word": "mirage",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mirage",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b28aee3-ce72-35e6-8012-ba1485237475",
                                        "entry_id": "6927ba6f-869f-35a5-8034-bce9e0155a09",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An optical phenomenon in which light is refracted through a layer of hot air close to the ground, often giving the illusion of a body of water."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4a018b9-6391-3dba-9b8e-79fcb3e2ed0a",
                                        "entry_id": "6927ba6f-869f-35a5-8034-bce9e0155a09",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An illusion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc1bb243-82d6-431c-a6cb-585d8b5eccbb",
                                                "sense_id": "b4a018b9-6391-3dba-9b8e-79fcb3e2ed0a",
                                                "text": "I remember hearing, that in the East the clear and azure waters seem to flow before the weary and parched traveller; yet a little further, and on he urges his weary way, but in vain—the fair stream is a delusion. Even thus happiness is the mirage which leads us over the desert of life, ever fated to end in deceit and disappointment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "mirage",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "10be5b0d-7a1b-3d03-b0ee-50cf910e11aa",
                                        "entry_id": "67a572aa-65ed-339c-a0dc-7ae4379b5c05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause to appear as or like a mirage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd0f4e2a-59a3-4d02-b15f-b06569b62ec7",
                                                "sense_id": "10be5b0d-7a1b-3d03-b0ee-50cf910e11aa",
                                                "text": "All that had been in his mind seemed suddenly miraged before him—the removal of Hunterleys, his own wife's failing health."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "785301b5-64f2-4cd8-a82d-7c7a606d1cb5",
                                                "sense_id": "10be5b0d-7a1b-3d03-b0ee-50cf910e11aa",
                                                "text": "The vision of a salon was miraged before her, with herself in the middle deftly manipulating the destinies of a nation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4f72a40e-ca53-450a-98b7-65188bb58589",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b909adf-f568-36cb-be88-ec8318f1966a",
                        "source_sense_id": "9eb88e8e-4b0a-3d51-a7ce-9b749b605064",
                        "target_lang_word": "mirage chaud",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d01ef2c5-58a8-4a2b-80e7-c7019a52e31d",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b909adf-f568-36cb-be88-ec8318f1966a",
                        "source_sense_id": "9eb88e8e-4b0a-3d51-a7ce-9b749b605064",
                        "target_lang_word": "mirage",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mirage",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16f20c16-e8f4-3b8b-8542-b44be45b3762",
                                        "entry_id": "fe1278ee-ab9b-3ac2-a99a-0b5d9e2470e6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Phénomène dû à l’incurvation des rayons lumineux se réfléchissant sur les couches surchauffées de l’atmosphère voisines du sol et donnant souvent l’impression d’une réflexion sur une grande étendue d’eau."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63d92032-e582-4e84-9204-554436d09103",
                                                "sense_id": "16f20c16-e8f4-3b8b-8542-b44be45b3762",
                                                "text": "Un autre phénomène de l’Égypte est celui du mirage, qui a été souvent décrit par des voyageurs trompés par l’apparence de grandes masses d’eau au milieu des sables. Quoique prévenu de cette illusion, j’avoue que j’y ai été trompé comme d’autres étrangers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "263d0f6e-382a-3130-bf15-7491bed53201",
                                        "entry_id": "fe1278ee-ab9b-3ac2-a99a-0b5d9e2470e6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Illusion trompeuse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a013422-ef9d-4548-b519-f5bf75551ecb",
                                                "sense_id": "263d0f6e-382a-3130-bf15-7491bed53201",
                                                "text": "[…] que je ne sois pas jouée comme toutes ces pauvres femmes, par ce besoin lamentable de se tromper soi-même, par ces mirages qu’un absurde espoir élève sur l’immensité désolée de l’océan de sang."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04e78acc-1237-44f1-b6a9-bf3da739300e",
                                                "sense_id": "263d0f6e-382a-3130-bf15-7491bed53201",
                                                "text": "Maîtriser des techniques comme exercer le métier d’historien est un long apprentissage, au cours duquel il faut apprendre à contourner les mirages."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb96961a-b0f0-40f1-8c44-b18b2f6c829c",
                                                "sense_id": "263d0f6e-382a-3130-bf15-7491bed53201",
                                                "text": "Notre incompréhension devant l’inconnu a dressé aux quatre coins du monde un atlas mythologique. Des centaines d'endroits où la virginité et le merveilleux se sont mués en eldorados, en paradis perdus, en enfers verts, en mirages et en abîmes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "22e3e9d7-1376-3455-9669-a1c6dfb2dbf7",
                                        "entry_id": "fe1278ee-ab9b-3ac2-a99a-0b5d9e2470e6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Promesse trompeuse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f35d8a3d-584d-4325-99f0-67c188441c19",
                                                "sense_id": "22e3e9d7-1376-3455-9669-a1c6dfb2dbf7",
                                                "text": "La reconstruction, quant à elle, semble être un mirage pour les Haïtiens, qui n’ont toujours pas de Palais national 11 ans après le tremblement de terre qui a coûté la vie à plus de 150 000 personnes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "mirage",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fa985303-c617-3a43-978f-106ece0881ba",
                                        "entry_id": "bb185b8f-ce20-3b53-b846-444f9ce31c4f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action de mirer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99bc9f28-d111-4c67-8897-065f5dab8271",
                                                "sense_id": "fa985303-c617-3a43-978f-106ece0881ba",
                                                "text": "Le mirage s’effectue avec une lampe sur laquelle on a adapté un dispositif permettant de concentrer la lumière sur une petite surface de l’œuf."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
